OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure following building
OL,4,Acollapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services are attending the
OL,7,Fscene of a partially-collapsed building
OL,8,Fon the Shankill Road in Belfast.
OL,10,FFirefighter were called to the scene
OL,11,Fjust before 08:00 BST and cleared
OL,12,Fdebris to make the scene safe.
OL,14,FThe road is currently closed closed at
OL,15,Fthe junctions of Tennent Street and
OL,16,FBrookemount Street.
OL,18,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,19,Fofficers remain in the area to assist
OL,20,Fwith road closures and motorists have
OL,21,Fbeen advised to avoid the area.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
